fluorine-desktop (0.1.1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Export QT_QPA_PLATFORMTHEME=qt6ct and ELECTRON_OZONE_PLATFORM_HINT=auto
    from the Hyprland session so Qt and Electron clients run natively on
    Wayland with the fluorine-artwork palettes.
  * Set XCURSOR_THEME, XCURSOR_SIZE, and HYPRCURSOR_SIZE for crisp cursors.
  * Announce every output with preferred mode, automatic placement, and
    scale 1, with commented 1.25 and 1.5 fractional examples.
  * Enable xwayland force_zero_scaling so legacy clients stay pixel-crisp.

 -- gowthvm <gowthamgkofficial@gmail.com>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 20:12:00 +0530

fluorine-desktop (0.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Add daily-driver workstation ergonomics.
  * hypridle now dims the panel at 5 minutes, locks the session at
    10 minutes, and suspends after 20 minutes only while on battery.
  * Bind the hardware volume, mute, microphone mute, and brightness keys to
    wpctl and brightnessctl, with silent fallback when no backlight exists.
  * Store clipboard history with cliphist and add SUPER + C to pick an entry
    and copy it back to the clipboard.
  * Run the flr-keys cheat sheet once on the first interactive login and
    record a marker under ~/.local/state/fluorine.
  * Declare cliphist, brightnessctl, and wireplumber as runtime dependencies.

 -- gowthvm <gowthamgkofficial@gmail.com>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 19:45:00 +0530

fluorine-desktop (0.0.3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Drop /usr/bin/start-hyprland. The hyprland package in trixie-backports
    already installs that wrapper, so shipping a second copy caused a dpkg
    file conflict that made the package uninstallable.

 -- gowthvm <gowthamgkofficial@gmail.com>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 19:30:00 +0530

